{"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Topics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/JSONBindable","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomError","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomCoreErrorCode"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/loomcore\/storingcustomtypes"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"How ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bindable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" maps Swift types to SQLite storage, and how to extend it.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"LoomCore"}],"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Storing Custom Types"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/IndexConventions","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/SafeInterpolation","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/ConcurrencyModel","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/QueryingJSON","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/FullTextSearch","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/TransactionsAndServices"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is the single extension point for type-safe parameter binding and column extraction. Every type LoomCore supports — from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"type":"text","text":" to your own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" structs — conforms to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and provides:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bind(to:value:at:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — write a value to a parameter slot."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"column(of:at:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — read a value from a column."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"asSQLLiteral()"},{"type":"text","text":" — produce a literal SQL representation for debugging."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"defaultSQLStorageType"},{"type":"text","text":" — the SQL type to use in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CREATE TABLE"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Built-in-conformances","type":"heading","text":"Built-in conformances"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SQLite storage"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TEXT"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UTF-8, single quotes doubled in literals"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int32"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int64"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"INTEGER"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" round-trips through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int64"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DOUBLE"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Round-trips through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":" — slight precision loss possible"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DOUBLE"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Native"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"INTEGER (0\/1)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Literal renders as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TRUE"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FALSE"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BLOB"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hex literals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X'…'"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DOUBLE"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unix timestamp seconds since 1970, UTC"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TextDate"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TEXT"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SQLite datetime text "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS.SSS"},{"type":"text","text":", UTC — for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"},{"type":"text","text":"-style columns"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UUID"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BLOB"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"16-byte raw bytes, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a TEXT string"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Optional<T>"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"underlying or NULL"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads NULL via column type check"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"derived from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawValue"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enum’s raw type’s storage"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Array"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Dictionary"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TEXT (JSON)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JSON-encoded"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TEXT (JSON)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JSON-encoded; you opt in by conforming to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/JSONBindable","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Custom-Codable-types","type":"heading","text":"Custom Codable types"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type can become "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by conforming to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/JSONBindable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — no implementation needed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Profile: Codable, JSONBindable {","  let displayName: String","  let avatarURL: URL?","  let preferences: [String: String]","}","","try await db.exec(","  \"CREATE TABLE accounts (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, profile TEXT)\"",")","","let profile = Profile(","  displayName: \"Alice\",","  avatarURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/a.png\"),","  preferences: [\"theme\": \"dark\"]",")","try await db.exec(\"INSERT INTO accounts (profile) VALUES (\\(profile))\")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Encoding uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and stores JSON TEXT, so stored values work directly with SQLite’s JSON functions — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"json_extract(profile, '$.displayName')"},{"type":"text","text":", the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"->"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"->>"},{"type":"text","text":" operators, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"json_set"},{"type":"text","text":", and friends. LoomCore exposes those functions as typed expressions:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let profile = ColumnExpression<String>(\"profile\")","let names = try await db.query(","  \"SELECT \\(profile.jsonValue(\"$.displayName\", as: String.self)) FROM accounts\"",") { stmt, _ in","  try String?.column(of: stmt, at: 0)","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/QueryingJSON","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for the full JSON querying, modification, and iteration API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JSON storage is opt-in so it never competes with other storage strategies: a raw-value enum declared "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum Role: String, Codable, Bindable"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps its raw-value storage ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"'admin'"},{"type":"text","text":", not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"'\"admin\"'"},{"type":"text","text":"). Don’t combine "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/JSONBindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"},{"type":"text","text":"-based "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" conformance on one type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"NULL-handling","type":"heading","text":"NULL handling"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-optional "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" types throw "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with code "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomCoreErrorCode\/nullValue","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" if the column contains NULL:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let names = try await db.query(raw: \"SELECT name FROM accounts\") { stmt, _ in","  try String.column(of: stmt, at: 0)  \/\/ throws if NULL","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Optional<T>"},{"type":"text","text":" to handle NULL explicitly:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let avatarURLs = try await db.query(raw: \"SELECT avatar_url FROM accounts\") { stmt, _ in","  try Optional<String>.column(of: stmt, at: 0)  \/\/ nil if NULL","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Optional"},{"type":"text","text":" checks "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sqlite3_column_type == SQLITE_NULL"},{"type":"text","text":" before delegating to the wrapped type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"RawRepresentable-enums","type":"heading","text":"RawRepresentable enums"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enums backed by a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" raw type can be stored directly:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["enum AccountState: Int, Bindable {","  case active = 0","  case suspended = 1","  case closed = 2","}","","try await db.exec(\"INSERT INTO accounts (state) VALUES (\\(AccountState.active))\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a stored value doesn’t map to a case (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state = 99"},{"type":"text","text":"), extraction throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with code "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomCoreErrorCode\/typeMappingFailed","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Writing your own Bindable","anchor":"Writing-your-own-Bindable","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For types that don’t fit Codable (e.g. you want to control storage layout), conform to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Bindable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly. The contract is small enough to implement in a few lines — see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bindable+UUID.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" for a self-contained example that stores 16 raw bytes via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sqlite3_bind_blob"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/StoringCustomTypes","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://LoomCore/documentation/LoomCore/ConcurrencyModel":{"url":"\/documentation\/loomcore\/concurrencymodel","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Concurrency and Actor Isolation","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCor